---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Sobre mí"
	description="Conoce a Gabriel Borrás Serra, Desarrollador Web Full Stack de Palma de Mallorca: experiencia, formación e intereses."
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<div class="about-container">
		<section class="hero">
			<div class="hero-text">
				<span class="hero-greeting">¡Hola! Me puedes llamar Biel</span>
				<h1>Gabriel Borrás Serra</h1>
				<p class="hero-role">Desarrollador Web Full Stack</p>
				<p class="hero-description">
					Apasionado por la tecnología, la informática, los videojuegos y la
					programación. Vivo en Palma de Mallorca, donde he convertido mi
					mayor afición en mi carrera profesional.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="hero-photo">
				<div class="photo-ring">
					<img src="/img/me3.jpg" alt="Gabriel Borrás Serra" loading="eager" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="info-cards" aria-label="Información personal, experiencia y formación">
			<div class="info-card">
				<div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="currentColor">
						<path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="card-text">
					<h2>Sobre mí</h2>
					<p>
						Tengo 28 años y nací el 15 de julio de 1998 en Palma de Mallorca.
						Mis mayores aficiones son los videojuegos y todo lo relacionado
						con el mundo de la informática y las nuevas tecnologías. También
						soy bastante fan de sagas de cine como Star Wars o Marvel y de
						la cultura «pop» en general.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="info-card">
				<div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="currentColor">
						<path d="M20 7h-4V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v11c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V9c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zM10 5h4v2h-4V5zm10 15H4V9h16v11z"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="card-text">
					<h2>Experiencia Profesional</h2>
					<p>
						Actualmente trabajo como Desarrollador Web en Viajes El Corte
						Inglés, en el departamento de Tecnología y Desarrollo
						(antiguamente Logitravel), ubicada en el Parc Bit de Palma.
						He vivido toda mi vida en Mallorca, donde resido a día de hoy
						junto a mis amigos y familiares.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="info-card">
				<div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="currentColor">
						<path d="M5 13.18v4L12 21l7-3.82v-4L12 17l-7-3.82zM12 3L1 9l11 6 9-4.91V17h2V9L12 3z"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="card-text">
					<h2>Formación</h2>
					<p>
						Soy Técnico Superior en Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Web, una de
						mis mayores aficiones que, por suerte, he podido convertir en
						mi carrera profesional. Me gradué en junio de 2019 en el
						instituto concertado Es Liceu, cumpliendo así uno de mis
						mayores sueños.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="interests-section">
			<h2 class="section-title">Mis intereses</h2>
			<ul class="interests-list">
				<li class="interest-chip">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="6" x2="10" y1="11" y2="11"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="9" y2="13"/><line x1="15" x2="15.01" y1="12" y2="12"/><line x1="18" x2="18.01" y1="10" y2="10"/><path d="M17.32 5H6.68a4 4 0 0 0-3.978 3.59c-.006.052-.01.101-.017.152C2.604 9.416 2 14.456 2 16a3 3 0 0 0 3 3c1 0 1.5-.5 2-1l1.414-1.414A2 2 0 0 1 9.828 16h4.344a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L17 18c.5.5 1 1 2 1a3 3 0 0 0 3-3c0-1.545-.604-6.584-.685-7.258-.007-.05-.011-.1-.017-.151A4 4 0 0 0 17.32 5z"/></svg>
					<span>Videojuegos</span>
				</li>
				<li class="interest-chip">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="8" x="5" y="2" rx="2"/><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2"/><path d="M6 18h.01"/><path d="M6 6h.01"/><path d="M18 6h.01"/><path d="M18 18h.01"/></svg>
					<span>Tecnología</span>
				</li>
				<li class="interest-chip">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.2 6 3 11l-.9-2.4c-.3-1.1.3-2.2 1.3-2.5l13.5-4c1.1-.3 2.2.3 2.5 1.3Z"/><path d="m6.2 5.3 3.1 3.9"/><path d="m12.4 3.4 3.1 4"/><path d="M3 11h18v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/></svg>
					<span>Cine</span>
				</li>
				<li class="interest-chip">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h12l4 6-10 13L2 9Z"/><path d="M11 3 8 9l4 13 4-13-3-6"/><path d="M2 9h20"/></svg>
					<span>Star Wars</span>
				</li>
				<li class="interest-chip">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"/></svg>
					<span>Marvel</span>
				</li>
				<li class="interest-chip">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/><path d="M5 3v4"/><path d="M19 17v4"/><path d="M3 5h4"/><path d="M17 19h4"/></svg>
					<span>Cultura Pop</span>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	:global(main) {
		width: 100% !important;
		max-width: 100% !important;
		margin: 0 !important;
		padding: 0 !important;
	}

	:global(article) {
		width: 100% !important;
		max-width: 1100px !important;
		margin: 0 auto !important;
		padding: 0 !important;
	}

	:global(.prose) {
		width: 100% !important;
		max-width: 100% !important;
		margin: 0 !important;
		padding: 0 !important;
	}

	:global(.title),
	:global(.hero-image) {
		display: none !important;
	}

	@keyframes fadeUp {
		from {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: translateY(12px);
		}
		to {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: translateY(0);
		}
	}

	.about-container {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem) 1rem 3rem;
	}

	.about-container > * {
		animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease-out both;
	}

	.hero {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
		align-items: center;
		gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
		padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(250, 110, 34, 0.07), rgba(170, 215, 217, 0.18));
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray), 0.12);
		border-radius: 24px;
	}

	.hero-greeting {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
		background: rgba(170, 215, 217, 0.35);
		border: 1px solid rgba(170, 215, 217, 0.8);
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}

	.hero h1 {
		margin: 0.9rem 0 0.25rem;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.15;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.hero-role {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.35rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.hero-description {
		margin: 0 auto;
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		max-width: 46ch;
	}

	.hero-photo {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.photo-ring {
		padding: 6px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #aad7d9);
		box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(250, 110, 34, 0.25);
	}

	.photo-ring img {
		display: block;
		width: clamp(170px, 26vw, 260px);
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 50%;
		border: 4px solid #fff;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.info-cards {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 1.5rem;
		animation-delay: 0.1s;
	}

	.info-card {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray), 0.1);
		border-radius: 16px;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(var(--gray), 0.12), 0 8px 24px rgba(var(--gray), 0.08);
		transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
	}

	.info-card::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 4px;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #aad7d9);
		transform: scaleX(0);
		transform-origin: left;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.info-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-6px);
		box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(var(--gray), 0.22);
	}

	.info-card:hover::before {
		transform: scaleX(1);
	}

	.card-icon {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 48px;
		height: 48px;
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: rgba(250, 110, 34, 0.12);
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.info-card h2 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.info-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}

	.interests-section {
		padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray), 0.1);
		border-radius: 16px;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(var(--gray), 0.12), 0 8px 24px rgba(var(--gray), 0.08);
		animation-delay: 0.2s;
	}

	.section-title {
		display: block;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-align: center;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.section-title::after {
		content: '';
		display: block;
		width: 48px;
		height: 3px;
		margin: 0.5rem auto 0;
		border-radius: 2px;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #aad7d9);
	}

	.interests-list {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 0.75rem;
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 1.75rem auto 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.interest-chip {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: flex-start;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray), 0.15);
		border-radius: 12px;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(var(--gray), 0.08);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
	}

	.interest-chip svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.interest-chip:hover {
		transform: translateY(-3px);
		border-color: var(--accent);
		box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(250, 110, 34, 0.18);
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.info-cards {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.hero {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			text-align: center;
		}

		.hero-photo {
			order: -1;
		}

		.info-card {
			padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
		}

		.interests-list {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 420px) {
		.about-container {
			padding: 0.75rem 0.75rem 2.5rem;
		}

		.interests-section {
			padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
		}

		.interest-chip {
			padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
			font-size: 0.85rem;
		}
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.about-container > * {
			animation: none;
		}

		.info-card,
		.interest-chip {
			transition: none;
		}
	}
</style>
